  "content": "<p>One of our members got tired of cutting screws to the right length by hand, so they  printed and built a handy jig for the Dremel to do it precisely.<br />3D model source:: <a href=\"https://cults3d.com/de/modell-3d/werkzeuge/dremel-miter-saw-fixture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">cults3d.com/de/modell-3d/werkz</span><span class=\"invisible\">euge/dremel-miter-saw-fixture</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/3dprinting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>3dprinting</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/dremel\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>dremel</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/diyhacks\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>diyhacks</span></a></p>",
